foundation-p0 : Block
foundation-p0 = prose (cons "**Foundation.** The foundation of computing and of intelligence is interaction, on networks of interaction. This is the foundation of decentralized computing and intelligence. It is as general as possible: the perfect abstraction of process and identity, which has been well understood for two thousand years." (cons "" (cons "There is no primitive thing, only a primitive law of interaction. A state is determined entirely by its future admissible interactions (Udāna 1.1; Nāgārjuna, Mūlamadhyamakakārikā 24.18; Tattvārtha Sūtra 5.21). Terms are proof-theoretic computational knowledge graphs. Their degrees of freedom are agency or unobservable history, under the laws of interaction, which are conditions of consistency and compatibility." (cons "" (cons "Composition proceeds under semantic consistency. Interaction preserves it: only operations that do not change the semantic identity of the system are admissible, because any other operation loses information. Semantic identity is all the properties proven and preserved (Tattvārtha Sūtra 5.30)." (cons "" (cons "Identities proven to be distinct representations of a single identity are contracted. Univalence transports data across them, and the result is productive lossless compression." nil)))))))
